        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Unique typing mini games – Each with different rules and challenges.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 1,000 leaderboards – One for every game and mode combination.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>7 Game modes that can be combined for a total of 128 unique combinations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/40edb98f2bd006f9f553bd578595b809.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>Uppercase Mode – Add uppercase letters into the mix.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/90b0c928738547d30344f9faf431c66f.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>Numbers Mode – Numbers now appear alongside letters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/e313b0e4d92dead1188eb565acdaf99d.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>Hard Mode – More enemies, less time, bigger challenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/f42ff023e67f88b5dde2ab290f0aa0fd.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>1 Health Mode – One mistake and it’s game over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/928475931153941e6b67714c90eb87fc.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>No Power Mode – Survive without your special ability.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/1cec55028a58b8e48e7caa61ca8d0d48.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>Rotation Mode – Letters appear rotated for extra confusion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/4674d21fe5ec1fa06cb3c8c0744e6069.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>Replace Mode – 4 letters are swapped with figures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Unique typing mini games – Each with different rules and challenges.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 1,000 leaderboards – One for every game and mode combination.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>7 Game modes that can be combined for a total of 128 unique combinations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/40edb98f2bd006f9f553bd578595b809.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>Uppercase Mode – Add uppercase letters into the mix.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/90b0c928738547d30344f9faf431c66f.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>Numbers Mode – Numbers now appear alongside letters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/e313b0e4d92dead1188eb565acdaf99d.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>Hard Mode – More enemies, less time, bigger challenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/f42ff023e67f88b5dde2ab290f0aa0fd.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>1 Health Mode – One mistake and it’s game over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/928475931153941e6b67714c90eb87fc.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>No Power Mode – Survive without your special ability.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/1cec55028a58b8e48e7caa61ca8d0d48.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>Rotation Mode – Letters appear rotated for extra confusion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987440/extras/4674d21fe5ec1fa06cb3c8c0744e6069.avif?t=1762230275\" width=66 height=73 /></span>     <strong>Replace Mode – 4 letters are swapped with figures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
